    "detailed_description": "<strong>Crowborne is a 2D platformer With the ability to Melee, shoot Run and Fly around!.</strong><br><br>The game follows the hero 'Twig', a crow who can take on a human form or a bird form and his<br>journey to find his best friend 'Flipper' a magical fox, who has been taken by Demons that have invaded Earth.<br><br><strong>The game features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>- 20 Levels with 3 Boss battles and many enemies to keep you on your game.<br></li><li>- Destructible terrain, mine the ground to find gold and other materials to level up your characters abilities!<br></li><li>- Deadly weaponry. Shoot, blow and slash your way through the demon filled world.<br></li><li>- Seamlessly Transform from human form into a bird form!<br></li><li>- Blood and gore to leave a sweet taste in your mouth.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Crowborne is a 2D platformer With the ability to Melee, shoot Run and Fly around!.</strong><br><br>The game follows the hero 'Twig', a crow who can take on a human form or a bird form and his<br>journey to find his best friend 'Flipper' a magical fox, who has been taken by Demons that have invaded Earth.<br><br><strong>The game features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>- 20 Levels with 3 Boss battles and many enemies to keep you on your game.<br></li><li>- Destructible terrain, mine the ground to find gold and other materials to level up your characters abilities!<br></li><li>- Deadly weaponry. Shoot, blow and slash your way through the demon filled world.<br></li><li>- Seamlessly Transform from human form into a bird form!<br></li><li>- Blood and gore to leave a sweet taste in your mouth.</li></ul>",
